  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Logic : Square of (1st number - 2nd number) = 3rd number**\n\n**Given :**\n\n \n• (12, 8, 16)\n\n​(12 - 8)² = 16\n\n(4)² = 16\n\n16 = 16\n\n \n• (22, 10, 144)\n\n​(22 - 10)² = 144\n\n(12)² = 144\n\n144 = 144\n\nSimilarly,\n\n \n• Option - 1 : (28, 20, 36)​\n\n​(28 - 20)² = 36\n\n(8)² = 64\n\n**64 ≠ 36** (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - 2 : (16, 10, 24)​\n\n​(16 - 10)² = 24\n\n(6)² = 24\n\n**36 ≠ 24** (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - 3 : (24, 12, 121)\n\n​​(24 - 12)² = 121\n\n(12)² = 121\n\n**144 ≠ 121** (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - 4 : (18, 8, 100)\n\n​(18 - 8)² = 100\n\n(10)² = 100\n\n**100 = 100** (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (4)\"** is the correct answer.\n\na9:T1087,\n<p&",
